# Allowlist: everything is ignored unless re-included below. Game-extracted data
# (analysis/, GameAssembly copies, dumps), build output (bin/obj), archives, evidence,
# release DLLs, logs and *.bak files stay out. Add one block per mod when it joins the repo.
/*
!/.gitignore

